Ideation Overview
Clipflow — video production and content operations platform (Web app)
Problem: You’re learning video editing, clipping, and AI at the same time. Campaign opportunities, tutorials, editing tools, and content trends are scattered across different platforms.
Requirement: One place to discover opportunities, learn the skills you need, and use what you learn on real editing projects.
Solution: Clipflow, a video production and content operations web app.
Clipflow — Final Feature List
Clipflow is a web app for learning video editing and running clipping and UGC projects. It connects the full workflow from finding an opportunity and organising raw footage to editing, reviewing, and tracking the result.

