The PostgreSQL-backed queue is an MVP design choice. Clipflow’s initial background workload is scheduled source checks and reminders, so one database can support it without deploying a separate broker. Editing happens in Adobe, CapCut, or the creator’s preferred tool. Clipflow manages the plan, footage, versions, and submission around that work.

